---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /proekti/
title: Проекти
description: Реализирани проекти на ДМД Комфорт по услуги — дограма, врати, плъзгащи системи, щори, тераси и обръщане.
---
{% from "macros/page-banner.njk" import pageBanner %}
{% from "macros/breadcrumbs.njk" import breadcrumbs %}

{% call pageBanner() %}
  <div class="eyebrow text-brand before:bg-brand">Портфолио</div>
  <h1 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl font-display text-[clamp(2.5rem,5vw,3.75rem)] font-black leading-none">Нашите проекти</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/70">Изберете услуга, за да видите обектите по нея.</p>
{% endcall %}

{{ breadcrumbs([
  { label: "Начало", url: "/" },
  { label: "Проекти" }
]) }}

<section class="section-pad bg-brand-mist">
  <div class="container-site grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-x-10 lg:gap-y-12">
    {% for group in projectGroups %}
      <a class="card reveal group block no-underline" href="{{ group.href | url }}">
        <div class="relative m-2.5 aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
          <img class="image-cover" src="{{ group.image | url }}" alt="{{ group.title }}" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="border-t border-ink/10 px-4 pb-5 pt-3.5">
          <h2 class="mb-1.5 font-display text-lg font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink group-hover:text-brand">{{ group.title }}</h2>
          <p class="m-0 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">{{ group.countLabel }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
